          "description": "FAQ Columns: the section's texts on the left and its Accordion (or FAQ Tabs) on the right, as on the FAQ design. FAQ Center: the same design in one centred column (title, description, tabs, accordion, then the button). Pick one of them, or neither for the normal layout"
